Chrome-la official-ah "Install" button trigger aaga kandippa oru Service Worker (sw.js) thevai bro. Browser service worker irundha thaan adhai real installable app-ah consider pannum.

Idhai 2 nimishathula add pannidalam:

Step 1: sw.js Nu Pudhu File Create Panninga
Unga repository (life-expensive) main page-ku ponga.

Mela Add file 
→ Create new file click pannunga.

File name: sw.js

Content box-la indha code-ai paste pannunga:

JavaScript
const CACHE_NAME = 'life-exp-v1';

self.addEventListener('install', (e) => {
  self.skipWaiting();
});

self.addEventListener('activate', (e) => {
  e.waitUntil(clients.claim());
});

self.addEventListener('fetch', (e) => {
  e.respondWith(
    fetch(e.request).catch(() => caches.match(e.request))
  );
});
