Top-la pachai/blue background box-la:Your site is live at [https://vishnu934299-tech.github.io/life-expensive/](https://vishnu934299-tech.github.io/life-expensive/) nu link kaatum. Pakkathula Visit site button-um irukkum.

Vazhi 2: Main Repo Page-laye (Right Side-la)

Mela irukkura Code tab-ai click panni main repo screen-ku vaanga.

Right side column-la keela scroll pannina Deployments nu oru heading irukkum.

Adhukku keela github-pages nu irukkum, adhai click pannina unga live link anga kaatum.

Direct-a indha URL-aiye neenga laptop browser-la pudhu tab open panni type panni paarkkalam:[https://vishnu934299-tech.github.io/life-expensive/](https://vishnu934299-tech.github.io/life-expensive/)

illa varala install varale

Chrome browser "Install" banner trigger panradhukku oru strict rule irukku bro: manifest.json file-la icons kandippa irukkanum (at least 192x192 and 512x512 size). Icons illana Chrome "Install" option tharaadhu, "Add to Home screen" mattum dhaan kaatum.

Indha rendey nimishathula icons-oda manifest update panniduvom:

Step: manifest.json File-ai Edit Panninga
Unga GitHub repo main page-ku ponga.

Anga irukkura manifest.json file-ai click pannunga.

Top right-la irukkura Pencil (Edit) icon click pannunga.

Ulla irukkura pazhaya code-ai muzhusum azhichittu, indha code-ai paste pannunga:

JSON
{
  "name": "Life Expensive",
  "short_name": "LifeExp",
  "start_url": "./index.html",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#090d16",
  "theme_color": "#090d16",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5501/5501375.png",
      "sizes": "192x192",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    },
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5501/5501375.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    }
  ]
}
Top right-la Commit changes... green button-ai click panni save pannidunga.

Phone-la Check Panna:
Oru 1 minute wait pannunga.

Phone Chrome-la andha tab-ai close pannitu, pudhu tab-la link-ai open pannunga.

Oru murai refresh pannunga.

Top 3 dots menu click pannina ippo "Install app" (illana screen keela auto-va install prompt) kandippa varum!

cannot be installed nu tha varuthu

Chrome-la "cannot be installed" nu error message varudhu na, adhukku main-a 2 common issues thaan kaaranam:

Chrome browser pazhaya cache-ai vachittu pudhu manifest.json / sw.js files-ai innum refresh panni edukala.

manifest.json start_url path illana icon link cache aagala.

Indha 2 simple steps panna udane fix aagidum:

Step 1: Unga Phone Chrome Cache-ai Clear Panninga
Phone Chrome-la unga site open pannina nilaimaiyil:

Top address bar-la irukkura Lock icon (illana tune/settings icon) click pannunga.

Cookies and site data (illana Site settings) click pannunga.

Anga Clear data / Trash icon click panni clear pannidunga.

Ipo andha page-ai fresh-a reload (refresh) pannunga.

Step 2: manifest.json-la Path Fix (GitHub Repo-la)
GitHub Pages-la subfolder name irukkuradhaala (/life-expensive/), start_url direct repo link-a irundha Chrome-ku error varadhu.

Unga GitHub repo-la manifest.json file open panni edit (pencil) icon click pannunga.

Idhai paste pannunga:

JSON
{
  "name": "Life Expensive",
  "short_name": "LifeExp",
  "id": "/life-expensive/",
  "start_url": "/life-expensive/",
  "scope": "/life-expensive/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#090d16",
  "theme_color": "#090d16",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5501/5501375.png",
      "sizes": "192x192",
      "type": "image/png"
    },
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5501/5501375.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png"
    }
  ]
}







